      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-16T05:17:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "GemPorts are mostly used in Bidirectional manner. But, they also allow configurations in each direction and I had seen some configurations that had different p-bit mappers in upstream and downstream. It is to support those kind of configurations that I have provided support for upstream and downstream gem ports.",
